ring-border/60 dark:inset-px dark:ring-white"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><a class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors cursor-pointer group text-xs block truncate font-medium" href="/apps/hermes-agent">Hermes Agent<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="inline w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.28 11.47a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.69 12 7.72 5.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l7.5 7.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><div class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-1 text-xs"><span class="truncate cursor-help inline-block" role="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_dl2rpepbqubsnqbt3dml9ivb_">Hermes Agent is an open-source, self-improving AI agent by Nous Research that runs persistently with memory across sessions, and builds reusable skills from experience. It comes with 40+ built-in tools, including web search, browser automation, and vision, plus scheduled automations and subagents.</span></div></div></div><div class="col-span-4 flex items-center justify-end gap-3 text-right text-muted-foreground text-xs"><div><span>8.32T</span><span class="ml-1">tokens</span></div></div></div><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-12 items-center"><div class="col-span-1 text-left text-muted-foreground">2<!-- -->.</div><div class="col-span-7 flex min-w-0 items-center gap-4 text-left"><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center box-content p-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-background size-6 shrink-0"><div class="absolute inset-px flex items-center justify-center [&amp;_img]:absolute [&amp;_img]:inset-0 [&amp;_img]:size-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain [&amp;_img]:rounded-sm"><div class="size-full"><picture class="h-full w-full shrink-0"><img width="256" h