ash-20260910\"}],\"queryHash\":\"[\\\"model-page\\\",\\\"benchmarkScores\\\",{\\\"permaslug\\\":\\\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\\\"}]\"},{\"dehydratedAt\":1791185767136,\"state\":{\"data\":[{\"aa_id\":\"dbe7c625-3100-4463-b479-a228c41f75dd\",\"aa_slug\":\"deepseek-v4-1-flash\",\"aa_name\":\"DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (Reasoning, Max Effort)\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\",\"openrouter_slug\":null,\"heuristic_openrouter_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"benchmark_data\":{\"model_type\":\"llm\",\"evaluations\":{\"artificial_analysis_intelligence_index\":39.5,\"artificial_analysis_coding_index\":null,\"artificial_analysis_agentic_index\":null,\"gdpval_aa\":0.55,\"aa_omniscience_accuracy\":0.464,\"aa_omniscience_non_hallucination_rate\":0.035,\"lcr\":0.84,\"ifbench\":null,\"gpqa\":null,\"hle\":0.392,\"scicode\":0.519,\"terminalbench_hard\":null,\"critpt\":0.143,\"tau2\":null}},\"last_updated_at\":1789862486088,\"percentiles\":{\"intelligence_percentile\":79,\"coding_percentile\":null,\"agentic_percentile\":null}}],\"dataUpdateCount\":1,\"dataUpdatedAt\":1791185767115,\"error\":null,\"errorUpdateCount\":0,\"errorUpdatedAt\":0,\"fetchFailureCount\":0,\"fetchFailureReason\":null,\"fetchMeta\":null,\"isInvalidated\":false,\"status\":\"success\",\"fetchStatus\":\"idle\"},\"queryKey\":[\"model-benchmarks\",\"artificialAnalysis\",{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\"}],\"queryHash\":\"[\\\"model-benchmarks\\\",\\\"artificialAnalysis\\\",{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\\\"}]\"},{\"dehydratedAt\":1791185767136,\"state\":{\"data\":{\"records\":[],\"eloBounds\":{\"min\":529,\"max\":1479}},\"dataUpdateCount\":1,\"dataUpdatedAt\":1791185767103,\"error\":null,\"errorUpdateCount\":0,\"errorUpdatedAt\":0,\"fetchFailureCount\":0,\"fetchFailureReason\":null,\"fetchMeta\":null,\"isInvalidated\":false,\"status\":\"success\",\"fetchStatus\":\"idle\"},\"queryKey\":[\"model-benchmarks\",\"designArena\",{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\"}],\"queryHash\":\"[\\\"model-benchmarks\\\",\\\"designArena\\\",{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\\\"}]\"},{\"dehydratedAt\":1791185767136,\"state\":{\"data\":{\"colos\":[\"IAD\",\"ORD\",\"FRA\",\"LHR\",\"NRT\",\"SJC\",\"AMS\",\"CDG\",\"PDX\",\"SIN\",\"SEA\",\"EWR\",\"LAX\",\"HEL\",\"DUB\",\"ARN\",\"ATL\",\"CMH\",\"IST\",\"DFW\",\"ICN\",\"WAW\",\"GRU\",\"PRG\",\"DEN\"]},\"dataUpdateCount\":1,\"dataUpdatedAt\":1791185767123,\"error\":null,\"errorUpdateCount\":0,\"errorUpdatedAt\":0,\"fetchFailureCount\":0,\"fetchFailureReason\":null,\"fetchMeta\":null,\"isInvalidated\":false,\"status\":\"success\",\"fetchStatus\":\"idle\"},\"queryKey\":[\"model-page\",\"topColos\",{\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\"}],\"queryHash\":\"[\\\"model-page\\\",\\\"topColos\\\",{\\\"permaslug\\\":\\\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\\\"}]\"}]},\"children\":[\"$L14a\",\"$L14b\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"14c:T45c,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash is a sparse mixture-of-experts model from DeepSeek, and the first built on the company's Causal Encoder-Decoder (CED) architecture. It activates 8B parameters on input and 16B on output from a 552B-parameter backbone, an asymmetric split that keeps per-token compute low relative to the model's total size. Image understanding is native to the architecture, with visual and text embeddings trained jointly from the start of pre-training rather than added afterward as in the earlier experimental [V4 Flash Vision Exp](https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp).\n\nIt is suited for coding, terminal, and computer-use agents, along with long-horizon tasks that must run to completion across many steps and long-context analysis. Compressed KV caching cuts cache memory to roughly a quarter of the previous Flash generation, significantly reducing costs on agentic workloads. DeepSeek positions it as the cost-efficient tier of the V4.1 family and reports that it exceeds [V4 Pro](https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813) on performance, speed, and task completion time.14d:T405,DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp is an experimental large language model released by DeepSeek as an intermediate step between V3.1 and future architectures. It introduces DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA), a fine-grained sparse attention mechanism designed to improve training and inference efficiency in long-context scenarios while maintaining output quality. Users can control the reasoning behaviour with the `reasoning` `enabled` boolean. [Learn more in our docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs/use-cases/reasoning-tokens#enable-reasoning-with-default-config)\n\nThe model was trained under conditions aligned with V3.1-Terminus to enable direct comparison. Benchmarking shows performance roughly on par with V3.1 across reasoning, coding, and agentic tool-use tasks, with minor tradeoffs and gains depending on the domain. This release focuses on validating architectural optimizations for extended context lengths rather than advancing raw task accuracy, making it primarily a research-oriented model for exploring efficient transformer designs.14e:T442,DeepSeek-V3.1 Terminus is an update to [DeepSeek V3.1](/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1) that maintains the model's original capabilities while addressing issues reported by users, including language consistency and agent capabilities, further optimizing the model's performance in coding and search agents. It is a large hybrid reasoning model (671B parameters, 37B active) that supports both thinking and non-thinking modes. It extends the DeepSeek-V3 base with a two-phase long-context training process, reaching up to 128K tokens, and uses FP8 microscaling for efficient inference. Users can control the reasoning behaviour with the `reasoning` `enabled` boolean. [Learn more in our docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs/use-cases/reasoning-tokens#enable-reasoning-with-default-config)\n\nThe model improves tool use, code generation, and reasoning efficiency, achieving performance comparable to DeepSeek-R1 on difficult benchmarks while responding more quickly. It supports structured tool calling, code agents, and search agents, making it suitable for research, coding, and agentic workflows. 108:[\"$\",\"$L10d\",null,{\"state\":{\"mutations\":[],\"queries\":[{\"dehydratedAt\":1791185767138,\"state\":{\"data\":{\"author\":{\"slug\":\"deepseek\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek\"},\"models\":[{\"slug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-pro-latest\",\"permaslug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-pro-latest\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek Pro Latest\",\"description\":\"This model always redirects to the latest model in the DeepSeek Pro family.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-14T15:19:34.462Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-flash-latest\",\"permaslug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-flash-latest\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek Flash Latest\",\"description\":\"This model always redirects to the latest model in the DeepSeek Flash family.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-14T15:19:10.625Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (batch)\",\"description\":\"$14c\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-10T06:21:25.180Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:batch\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-20260910:batch\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.000000112\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000000336\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000000336\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.000000112\",\"completion\":\"0.000000336\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000000336\",\"discount\":0.3}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp-20260821\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Exp\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Exp is an experimental vision-enabled version of [DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731](https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731) from DeepSeek, adding image understanding while matching the base model on text capabilities including agents, reasoning, and world knowledge. It is a sparse mixture-of-experts model with 13B active parameters out of 284B total.\\n\\nIt is suited for document and chart understanding, visual question answering, and multimodal agent workflows that interleave text and images.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-21T11:26:03.963Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp-20260821\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000002156\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000006468\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000000686\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000002156\",\"completion\":\"0.0000006468\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000000686\",\"discount\":0.51}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-20260813\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Pro 0813\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek V4 Pro 0813 is a large-scale mixture-of-experts model from DeepSeek. This is the GA release of DeepSeek V4 Pro.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T15:42:44.768Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-20260813\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000001901\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000042\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000019\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000001901\",\"completion\":\"0.0000042\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000019\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-latest\",\"permaslug\":\"~deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-latest\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Flash Latest\",\"description\":\"This model always redirects to the latest model in the DeepSeek V4 Flash family.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-01T17:40:09.038Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260731\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731 is a sparse mixture-of-experts model from DeepSeek, with 13B active parameters out of 284B total. This re-post-trained revision is suited for coding, reasoning, and agent workflows. This is the GA release of DeepSeek V4 Flash.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-31T06:21:48.816Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260731\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000000152\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000128\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.0000000152\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000000152\",\"completion\":\"0.00000128\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000000152\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-20260423\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Pro 0423\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek V4 Pro is a large-scale Mixture-of-Experts model from DeepSeek with 1.6T total parameters and 49B activated parameters, supporting a 1M-token context window. It is designed for advanced reasoning, coding, and long-horizon agent workflows, with strong performance across knowledge, math, and software engineering benchmarks.\\n\\nBuilt on the same architecture as DeepSeek V4 Flash, it introduces a hybrid attention system for efficient long-context processing. Reasoning efforts high and xhigh are supported; xhigh maps to max reasoning. It is well suited for complex workloads such as full-codebase analysis, multi-step automation, and large-scale information synthesis, where both capability and efficiency are critical\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-24T03:17:59.654Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-20260423\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000002067\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000042\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000021\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000002067\",\"completion\":\"0.0000042\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000021\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4 Flash 0423\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek V4 Flash is an efficiency-optimized Mixture-of-Experts model from DeepSeek with 284B total parameters and 13B activated parameters, supporting a 1M-token context window. It is designed for fast inference and high-throughput workloads, while maintaining strong reasoning and coding performance.\\n\\nThe model includes hybrid attention for efficient long-context processing. Reasoning efforts `high` and `xhigh` are supported; `xhigh` maps to max reasoning. It is well suited for applications such as coding assistants, chat systems, and agent workflows where responsiveness and cost efficiency are important.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-24T03:17:46.710Z\",\"context_length\":1048576,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-20260423\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000128\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000003\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000003\",\"completion\":\"0.00000128\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000003\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-speciale\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-speciale-20251201\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.2 Speciale\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek-V3.2-Speciale is a high-compute variant of DeepSeek-V3.2 optimized for maximum reasoning and agentic performance. It builds on DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA) for efficient long-context processing, then scales post-training reinforcement learning to push capability beyond the base model. Reported evaluations place Speciale ahead of GPT-5 on difficult reasoning workloads, with proficiency comparable to Gemini-3.0-Pro, while retaining strong coding and tool-use reliability. Like V3.2, it benefits from a large-scale agentic task synthesis pipeline that improves compliance and generalization in interactive environments.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-01T13:13:57.971Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-20251201\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.2\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek-V3.2 is a large language model designed to harmonize high computational efficiency with strong reasoning and agentic tool-use performance. It introduces DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA), a fine-grained sparse attention mechanism that reduces training and inference cost while preserving quality in long-context scenarios. A scalable reinforcement learning post-training framework further improves reasoning, with reported performance in the GPT-5 class, and the model has demonstrated gold-medal results on the 2025 IMO and IOI. V3.2 also uses a large-scale agentic task synthesis pipeline to better integrate reasoning into tool-use settings, boosting compliance and generalization in interactive environments.\\n\\nUsers can control the reasoning behaviour with the `reasoning` `enabled` boolean. [Learn more in our docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs/use-cases/reasoning-tokens#enable-reasoning-with-default-config)\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-01T13:10:42.818Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-20251201\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000002088\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000003096\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.0000000216\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000002088\",\"completion\":\"0.0000003096\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.0000000216\",\"discount\":0.28}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-exp\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-exp\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.2 Exp\",\"description\":\"$14d\",\"created_at\":\"2025-09-29T12:54:41.802Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-exp\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2-exp\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000027\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000041\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000027\",\"completion\":\"0.00000041\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.1 Terminus\",\"description\":\"$14e\",\"created_at\":\"2025-09-22T13:37:55.611Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000027\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.000001\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000027\",\"completion\":\"0.000001\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.1\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek-V3.1 is a large hybrid reasoning model (671B parameters, 37B active) that supports both thinking and non-thinking modes via prompt templates. It extends the DeepSeek-V3 base with a two-phase long-context training process, reaching up to 128K tokens, and uses FP8 microscaling for efficient inference. Users can control the reasoning behaviour with the `reasoning` `enabled` boolean. [Learn more in our docs](https://openrouter.ai/docs/use-cases/reasoning-tokens#enable-reasoning-with-default-config)\\n\\nThe model improves tool use, code generation, and reasoning efficiency, achieving performance comparable to DeepSeek-R1 on difficult benchmarks while responding more quickly. It supports structured tool calling, code agents, and search agents, making it suitable for research, coding, and agentic workflows. \\n\\nIt succeeds the [DeepSeek V3-0324](/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324) model and performs well on a variety of tasks.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-08-21T12:33:48.000Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000025\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000095\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000013\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.00000025\",\"completion\":\"0.00000095\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000013\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-base\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-base\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3.1 Base\",\"description\":\"This is a base model, trained only for raw next-token prediction. Unlike instruct/chat models, it has not been fine-tuned to follow user instructions. Prompts need to be written more like training text or examples rather than simple requests (e.g., “Translate the following sentence…” instead of just “Translate this”).\\n\\nDeepSeek-V3.1 Base is a 671B parameter open Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model with 37B active parameters per forward pass and a context length of 128K tokens. Trained on 14.8T tokens using FP8 mixed precision, it achieves high training efficiency and stability, with strong performance across language, reasoning, math, and coding tasks. \\n\",\"created_at\":\"2025-08-20T21:56:57.365Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-distill-qwen-7b\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-distill-qwen-7b\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: R1 Distill Qwen 7B\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is a 7 billion parameter dense language model distilled from DeepSeek-R1, leveraging reinforcement learning-enhanced reasoning data generated by DeepSeek's larger models. The distillation process transfers advanced reasoning, math, and code capabilities into a smaller, more efficient model architecture based on Qwen2.5-Math-7B. This model demonstrates strong performance across mathematical benchmarks (92.8% pass@1 on MATH-500), coding tasks (Codeforces rating 1189), and general reasoning (49.1% pass@1 on GPQA Diamond), achieving competitive accuracy relative to larger models while maintaining smaller inference costs.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-30T18:03:57.186Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528-qwen3-8b\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528-qwen3-8b\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek R1 0528 Qwen3 8B\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek-R1-0528 is a lightly upgraded release of DeepSeek R1 that taps more compute and smarter post-training tricks, pushing its reasoning and inference to the brink of flagship models like O3 and Gemini 2.5 Pro.\\nIt now tops math, programming, and logic leaderboards, showcasing a step-change in depth-of-thought.\\nThe distilled variant, DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B, transfers this chain-of-thought into an 8 B-parameter form, beating standard Qwen3 8B by +10 pp and tying the 235 B “thinking” giant on AIME 2024.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-29T17:09:03.280Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: R1 0528\",\"description\":\"May 28th update to the [original DeepSeek R1](/deepseek/deepseek-r1) Performance on par with [OpenAI o1](/openai/o1), but open-sourced and with fully open reasoning tokens. It's 671B parameters in size, with 37B active in an inference pass.\\n\\nFully open-source model.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-28T17:59:30.833Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":{\"model_variant_slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528\",\"model_variant_permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528\",\"display_pricing\":[{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Input Price\",\"price\":\"0.0000005\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Output Price\",\"price\":\"0.00000215\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"},{\"kind\":\"token\",\"sku_label\":\"Cache Read\",\"price\":\"0.00000035\",\"displayMultiplier\":1000000,\"unitLabel\":\"/M tokens\"}],\"is_free\":false,\"pricing\":{\"prompt\":\"0.0000005\",\"completion\":\"0.00000215\",\"input_cache_read\":\"0.00000035\",\"discount\":0}}},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-prover-v2\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-prover-v2\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek Prover V2\",\"description\":\"DeepSeek Prover V2 is a 671B parameter model, speculated to be geared towards logic and mathematics. Likely an upgrade from [DeepSeek-Prover-V1.5](https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-Prover-V1.5-RL) Not much is known about the model yet, as DeepSeek released it on Hugging Face without an announcement or description.\",\"created_at\":\"2025-04-30T11:38:14.302Z\",\"context_length\":163840,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null},{\"slug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3-base\",\"permaslug\":\"deepseek/deepseek-v3-base\",\"name\":\"DeepSeek: DeepSeek V3 Base\",\"description\":\"Note that this is a base model mostly meant for testing, you need to provide detailed prompts for the model to return useful responses. \\n\\nDeepSeek-V3 Base is a 671B parameter open Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model with 37B active parameters per forward pass and a context length of 128K tokens. Trained on 14.8T tokens using FP8 mixed precision, it achieves high training efficiency and stability, with strong performance across language, reasoning, math, and coding tasks. \\n\\nDeepSeek-V3 Base is the pre-trained model behind [DeepSeek V3](/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3)\",\"created_at\":\"2025-03-29T18:13:43.339Z\",\"context_length\":131072,\"output_modalities\":[\"text\"],\"endpoint\":null}]},\"dataUpdateCount\":1,\"dataUpdatedAt\":1791185737138,\"error\":null,\"errorUpdateCount\":0,\"errorUpdatedAt\":0,\"fetchFailureCount\":0,\"fetchFailureReason\":null,\"fetchMeta\":null,\"isInvalidated\":false,\"status\":\"success\",\"fetchStatus\":\"idle\"},\"queryKey\":[\"author-models\",\"detail\",{\"authorSlug\":\"deepseek\"}],\"queryHash\":\"[\\\"author-models\\\",\\\"detail\\\",{\\\"authorSlug\\\":\\\"deepseek\\\"}]\"}]},\"children\":\"$L14f\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"150:I[77418,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1zet098htcd4i.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ncwfr4wdrrub.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2xgvr_umi0kh_.js\",\"/_next/stati